{"data": [{"author_id": "1499198533106540546", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:14:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118512352081711584"], "id": "2118512352081711584", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey AI 帮 AI 做研发，进步翻倍：这大概是史上最认真的“自己给自己加班”。", "url": "https://x.com/ajutqs/status/2118512352081711584"}, {"author_id": "1458357745", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:12:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118511801453445602"], "id": "2118511801453445602", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey METR 说 1.9 倍这个数，把三个没发布的内部模型也算进去了。想问下：如果不算内部模型，公开版大概还剩多少倍？", "url": "https://x.com/zhang_kenneth/status/2118511801453445602"}, {"author_id": "1637338068662329346", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:12:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118511721060962361"], "id": "2118511721060962361", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1694943359255957504", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118497318878208084", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@linxlbuilds @dotey 锁真实工单样本这招好，新模型来了不用等公开榜，直接拿同一套样本跑一遍就知道行不行。Thinking Machines 刚发的 Inkling 2 Small 可以当第一个试的，SWE-bench Pro 86.3%、FrontierCode 25.4%，下周 Apache 2.0 开源权重，现在 Tinker 上就能试。https://t.co/p5I8TPqdrZ", "url": "https://x.com/zhishen63629282/status/2118511721060962361"}, {"author_id": "1616553472207523840", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:04:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118509744843538457"], "id": "2118509744843538457", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 能力翻倍如果真有一半来自 AI 参与研发，那后面的加速度还会更夸张。METR 自己也说不确定，我更想看 Anthropic 那份内部复盘怎么对上这块。", "url": "https://x.com/chnhn05782803/status/2118509744843538457"}, {"author_id": "1922921330699120640", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:58:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118508312685920567"], "id": "2118508312685920567", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 报告里最该划线的不是翻倍，是那个限定词：加速主要落在目标明确的任务上，开放性任务是不是同速，报告自己也说不确定。AI 参与研发 AI 这个解释也留了口子，到底是模型变强了，还是评估用的任务刚好撞上它的长处，报告没敢把话说死。翻倍听着吓人，限定词才是诚实的部分。", "url": "https://x.com/DJC125765252591/status/2118508312685920567"}, {"author_id": "1254217568165888000", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:58:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118508287092212041"], "id": "2118508287092212041", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey AI把研发推得越快 安全评估就越不能让公司自己划禁区", "url": "https://x.com/zomeha38/status/2118508287092212041"}, {"author_id": "2054800349408768000", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:52:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118506875293769922"], "id": "2118506875293769922", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 原文几个数值得单独拎出来：\n\n1. AECI 自 2025 年 10 月起增速约 1.9 倍（95% CI 1.5–2.8），相当于一年走完以前约两年\n2. METR 较有把握排除「训练算力突然加速」这条解释\n3. 加速主要落在「目标明确的任务」；开放性任务是否同速，报告自己也说不确定", "url": "https://x.com/wangchuan0056/status/2118506875293769922"}, {"author_id": "392425784", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:42:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118504171334979702"], "id": "2118504171334979702", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey METR 说 Anthropic 能力进步速度大约翻倍，大头可能归功于 AI 参与研发，这判断够扎眼。", "url": "https://x.com/XXKING/status/2118504171334979702"}, {"author_id": "2829222264", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:19:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118498365088596200"], "id": "2118498365088596200", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 自己评估自己进步快，这报告我熟。", "url": "https://x.com/isotankGG/status/2118498365088596200"}, {"author_id": "1694943359255957504", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:14:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497318878208084"], "id": "2118497318878208084", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 给客户做模型选型时，我也不再只盯公开榜。\n\nMETR 自己也说 2 倍这个数很飘，换算法能从 1.1 掉到 2.9。私有化交付更稳的做法是先锁三五个真实工单样本，每月用同一套回归测一遍，别拿别人的合成指数当合同条款。", "url": "https://x.com/linxlbuilds/status/2118497318878208084"}, {"author_id": "1385059081958805504", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:14:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497148388225514"], "id": "2118497148388225514", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 多留多久再发布，报告里写了吗", "url": "https://x.com/0xUnite518/status/2118497148388225514"}, {"author_id": "2107064250250469376", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:11:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118496547931570433"], "id": "2118496547931570433", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 翻倍本身还不是最关键的，关键是两个能验证风险的口子都没了：加速的证据被大量涂黑，算力分给能力还是安全的核查又中途取消了。速度翻倍、安全投入有没有跟上，现在只能等Anthropic自己那份报告来说。", "url": "https://x.com/moxingzhex/status/2118496547931570433"}, {"author_id": "955232320063090693", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:07:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118495378127654997"], "id": "2118495378127654997", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 这个2倍要打个折：换一种统计假设结果在1.1到2.9倍之间，别的公司模型只有约1.4倍。更关键的是METR最有说服力的证据大多被涂黑了，公众没法自己核对。能力曲线确实在加速，但今天市场跌的是交付和融资，不是这个数字。", "url": "https://x.com/TheEaglegon/status/2118495378127654997"}, {"author_id": "1648903034691530752", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:56:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118492792242782302"], "id": "2118492792242782302", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey AI卷AI，赢麻了", "url": "https://x.com/xiaoshan0413/status/2118492792242782302"}, {"author_id": "1859247153279062016", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:53:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118491941021372837"], "id": "2118491941021372837", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 我这边一人公司就是这么跑的：一个AI写、一个AI审，我只验收，体感上迭代速度确实不是线性涨的\n但有个疑问，能力翻倍里，有多少是AI参与研发的功劳，有多少是评测任务越来越偏向AI擅长的题型？这个不分开看，容易高估", "url": "https://x.com/hual40889/status/2118491941021372837"}, {"author_id": "1872403399989424128", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:42:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118489255140073659"], "id": "2118489255140073659", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 自适应进化，迭代得越来越快", "url": "https://x.com/ljhspurs/status/2118489255140073659"}, {"author_id": "322519317", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:44:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118474628134019321"], "id": "2118474628134019321", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 总结很清楚。最值得关注的两点：\n1.  进步速度大概翻倍（1.3–3 倍区间），AI 参与研发可能贡献了大部分，但目前主要还是当助手，不是完全自主做核心贡献。\n2.  关键证据被大量涂黑，公众只能更多依赖 METR 的判断。这种“独立评估”的信息透明度确实受限。\n如果未来 12", "url": "https://x.com/gejianxin/status/2118474628134019321"}, {"author_id": "3321002460", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:39:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118473398947078396"], "id": "2118473398947078396", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 过去一年顶之前两年，AI给自己打工这事终于有人量化了😮 内部多留一段再发布这个细节最耐人寻味。", "url": "https://x.com/lzuren2001/status/2118473398947078396"}, {"author_id": "1637338068662329346", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:32:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118471630649495855"], "id": "2118471630649495855", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 涂黑那段看得我有点矛盾：说加速主要靠 AI 做研发的是 METR，但最能证明这点的证据又被涂掉了，等于结论只能先信 METR 的判断。还有个细节，内部模型在每项测试上都过 50% 了，难题快不够用，以后这 2 倍还怎么测得准？", "url": "https://x.com/zhishen63629282/status/2118471630649495855"}, {"author_id": "1672819239911055360", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:26:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118470098964865350"], "id": "2118470098964865350", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3178231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118466539510960161", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dotey 模型进步快一倍挺好，付钱用户更关心五小时额度有没有跟着涨😅", "url": "https://x.com/DeepSuck69/status/2118470098964865350"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1499198533106540546", "name": "Ajut Q", "username": "ajutqs"}, {"id": "1458357745", "name": "KenZ", "username": "zhang_kenneth"}, {"id": "1637338068662329346", "name": "Theo", "username": "zhishen63629282"}, {"id": "1616553472207523840", "name": "AI Pocket Report", "username": "chnhn05782803"}, {"id": "1922921330699120640", "name": "DJ C", "username": "DJC125765252591"}, {"id": "1254217568165888000", "name": "打螺丝的Dave", "username": "zomeha38"}, {"id": "2054800349408768000", "name": "忘川", "username": "wangchuan0056"}, {"id": "392425784", "name": "邪修King🚀", "username": "XXKING"}, {"id": "2829222264", "name": "MING", "username": "isotankGG"}, {"id": "1694943359255957504", "name": "林小狼", "username": "linxlbuilds"}, {"id": "1385059081958805504", "name": "0xUnite🐾", "username": "0xUnite518"}, {"id": "2107064250250469376", "name": "韦尔のD", "username": "moxingzhex"}, {"id": "955232320063090693", "name": "Eaglegon | AI × Chips", "username": "TheEaglegon"}, {"id": "1648903034691530752", "name": "Wen | 阿栗AI", "username": "xiaoshan0413"}, {"id": "1859247153279062016", "name": "诗诗爱吃辣", "username": "hual40889"}, {"id": "1872403399989424128", "name": "JimmyJacy", "username": "ljhspurs"}, {"id": "322519317", "name": "Ge Jianxin | 科技说人话", "username": "gejianxin"}, {"id": "3321002460", "name": "Laosun", "username": "lzuren2001"}, {"id": "1672819239911055360", "name": "大鹏博士", "username": "DeepSuck69"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2118512352081711584", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyxj8pk2l1276hxfc3hekwpim4d", "oldest_id": "2118470098964865350", "result_count": 20}}